# Writer 11 (tally 2.1, 2.1-6). L §3.5: "or enters its parties at parties itself when it declares none".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
ask q: count(p in parties on 2026-06-30)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  parties + [ania] lives 1980-01-01..
  parties + [firm] lives 2001-01-01..
=== expect
q: 2
  cut 2026-01-01
